{"seq":2,"slug":"tesla-unit-and-honors","title":"特斯拉单位与命名荣誉","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/nikola-tesla/influence-and-legacy/scientific-and-technical-legacy/tesla-unit-and-honors","wordCount":1669,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"特斯拉单位与命名荣誉\">特斯拉单位与命名荣誉</h1><p>在物理学的&quot;荣誉殿堂&quot;里，能让自己的名字变成一个国际单位的科学家屈指可数：牛顿（力）、焦耳（能量）、瓦特（功率）、安培（电流）……尼古拉·特斯拉也位列其中。1960 年，磁通密度的国际单位被正式命名为&quot;特斯拉&quot;（符号 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>）。这一命名不只是纪念，更是一种制度性的承认——它把特斯拉的名字写进了每一位学物理的人必须使用的语言。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-从-cgs-制到国际单位制的-特斯拉\">核心概念：从 CGS 制到国际单位制的&quot;特斯拉&quot;</h2><p>在 1960 年之前，磁场强度多用 CGS 制中的&quot;高斯&quot;（gauss）或&quot;奥斯特&quot;度量，这套体系与国际通行的电学单位（安培、伏特）衔接时常出现不一致。1960 年 10 月，第 11 届国际计量大会（CGPM）在巴黎确立国际单位制（SI）框架，并将磁通密度单位命名为特斯拉，提供了与安培、牛顿协调一致的相干单位。提议以特斯拉命名的，是南斯拉夫学者 France Avčin。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  A[CGS 制&lt;br/&gt;高斯 / 奥斯特] --&gt; B[衔接不一致]&#10;  B --&gt; C[1960 年第 11 届 CGPM]&#10;  C --&gt; D[国际单位制 SI]&#10;  D --&gt; E[磁通密度单位&lt;br/&gt;特斯拉 T]\">flowchart LR\n  A[CGS 制&lt;br/&gt;高斯 / 奥斯特] --&gt; B[衔接不一致]\n  B --&gt; C[1960 年第 11 届 CGPM]\n  C --&gt; D[国际单位制 SI]\n  D --&gt; E[磁通密度单位&lt;br/&gt;特斯拉 T]</pre><p>下表给出特斯拉单位与相关量的换算与定义，帮助读者把&quot;荣誉&quot;落到可计算的物理量上。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>物理量</th>\n<th>单位</th>\n<th>与特斯拉的关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>磁通密度</td>\n<td>特斯拉 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>基本被命名单位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>磁通密度</td>\n<td>高斯 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span>（CGS）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>4</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\,T = 10^4\\,G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>磁通</td>\n<td>韦伯 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Wb</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>W</mi><mi>b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\,T = 1\\,Wb/m^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>力—电流定义</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>k</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\,T = 1\\,kg\\cdot s^{-2}\\cdot A^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"特斯拉单位的物理定义\">特斯拉单位的物理定义</h2><p>特斯拉作为导出单位，可由洛伦兹力直接定义。一段载流导线在磁场中受力为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F = B I L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 为磁通密度。当 1 安培电流通过 1 米长导线、在垂直磁场中受到 1 牛顿力时，该磁场的磁通密度即为 1 特斯拉。换用 SI 基本单位表达：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mtext> </mtext><mfrac><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\,T = 1\\,\\frac{kg}{s^2 \\cdot A}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>为建立直观尺度感：地球表面磁场约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>25</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">25</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25</span></span></span></span></span>–<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>65</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>μ</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">65\\,\\mu T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">65</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>（微特斯拉），冰箱贴磁体约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>m</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5\\,mT</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>，医院核磁共振成像（MRI）的强磁场常达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span></span></span></span></span>–<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\,T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>，而实验室超导磁体可达数十特斯拉。可见在日常语境里，1 特斯拉已是相当强的磁场。</p>\n<h2 id=\"命名荣誉的谱系\">命名荣誉的谱系</h2><p>以特斯拉命名的事物远不止一个物理单位，它们共同构成一条&quot;命名荣誉&quot;的谱系，横跨科学、地理、商业与航天：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>国际单位</strong>：磁通密度单位特斯拉（1960）。</li>\n<li><strong>航天与天文</strong>：月球背面有以他命名的&quot;特斯拉环形山&quot;（Tesla crater）；小行星 2244 Tesla 亦以他命名。</li>\n<li><strong>基础设施</strong>：塞尔维亚首都的&quot;贝尔格莱德尼古拉·特斯拉机场&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>货币与符号</strong>：塞尔维亚 100 第纳尔纸币印有其肖像；他曾出现在前南斯拉夫货币上。</li>\n<li><strong>商业品牌</strong>：埃隆·马斯克的电动车与能源公司 Tesla, Inc. 以其命名（详见第二章）。</li>\n<li><strong>学术奖项</strong>：IEEE 设有&quot;尼古拉·特斯拉奖&quot;，表彰在电力技术领域作出杰出贡献者。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这条谱系的有趣之处在于：它跨越了&quot;科学共同体的承认&quot;（单位、奖项、天体命名）与&quot;大众文化的征用&quot;（货币、品牌）两个层面，而后者的热度在 21 世纪甚至盖过了前者。</p>\n<h2 id=\"命名荣誉的层级与稀缺性\">命名荣誉的层级与稀缺性</h2><p>以人名命名国际单位虽是最高规格的承认，但&quot;命名荣誉&quot;本身分若干层级，含金量与稳定性各不相同。下表按层级排列：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>例子</th>\n<th>性质</th>\n<th>稳定性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>国际单位</td>\n<td>特斯拉（磁通密度）</td>\n<td>制度性、可测量</td>\n<td>极高，随物理定义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>学术奖项</td>\n<td>IEEE 尼古拉·特斯拉奖</td>\n<td>共同体内部认可</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>天体命名</td>\n<td>月球环形山、小行星</td>\n<td>国际天文学联合会</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>基础设施命名</td>\n<td>贝尔格莱德机场</td>\n<td>国家标准</td>\n<td>较高，或随政策变动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>商业品牌</td>\n<td>Tesla, Inc.</td>\n<td>私人企业</td>\n<td>低，随商业沉浮</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>分层之后可见一个关键差异：前几层由科学共同体或国际组织赋予，几乎不随舆论起落而改变；而最广为人知的商业品牌层，恰恰是最不稳定、也最容易被误当作&quot;特斯拉地位来源&quot;的一层。把这两者分清，是理解其遗产时最容易被忽略却最重要的一步。</p>\n<h2 id=\"荣誉背后的张力\">荣誉背后的张力</h2><p>把名字铸成国际单位，是科学共同体能给予的最冷静、也最持久的承认——它不依赖传记叙事，只依赖物理定义。然而正是这种&quot;制度性承认&quot;，与流行文化中&quot;被压制的天才&quot;叙事形成了微妙反差：一方面，主流科学早已用最高规格纪念他；另一方面，大众传说却坚持认为他&quot;被埋没&quot;。</p>\n<p>理解这一反差很重要：特斯拉单位的存在恰恰证明，特斯拉从未被科学界遗忘或刻意贬低。真正&quot;遗忘&quot;过他的，是一般公众的记忆，而这份记忆又在互联网时代被重新点燃。命名荣誉因此成为一个有力的反证，提醒我们区分&quot;科学史中的特斯拉&quot;与&quot;大众想象中的特斯拉&quot;。</p>\n<p>还需补充一点尺度感：以人名命名国际单位是一项极为稀缺的荣誉，整个国际单位制中也仅有二十余个被命名单位。能与牛顿、焦耳、安培、伏特、赫兹并列，意味着科学共同体把特斯拉的贡献置于物理学最基础的层级之一。这种承认不会随舆论起落而改变，也不依赖任何传记叙事——只要人类还在测量磁场，他的名字就会被使用。从这个意义上说，1960 年的命名给了特斯拉一种比任何雕像或博物馆都更持久的&quot;遗产载体&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>1960 年第 11 届 CGPM 将磁通密度的国际单位命名为特斯拉（符号 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>），由 France Avčin 提议。</li>\n<li>特斯拉由洛伦兹力 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F = BIL</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 定义，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>k</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\,T = 1\\,kg\\cdot s^{-2}\\cdot A^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>4</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\,T = 10^4\\,G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>以他命名的还有月球环形山、小行星、贝尔格莱德机场、塞尔维亚货币肖像、IEEE 奖项与 Tesla, Inc. 品牌。</li>\n<li>国际单位这一&quot;制度性承认&quot;反证了特斯拉从未被科学界遗忘，与&quot;被压制天才&quot;的大众叙事形成反差。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"特斯拉单位与命名荣誉","id":"特斯拉单位与命名荣誉"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：从 CGS 制到国际单位制的\"特斯拉\"","id":"核心概念-从-cgs-制到国际单位制的-特斯拉"},{"level":2,"text":"特斯拉单位的物理定义","id":"特斯拉单位的物理定义"},{"level":2,"text":"命名荣誉的谱系","id":"命名荣誉的谱系"},{"level":2,"text":"命名荣誉的层级与稀缺性","id":"命名荣誉的层级与稀缺性"},{"level":2,"text":"荣誉背后的张力","id":"荣誉背后的张力"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"交流电网与现代电力系统","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/nikola-tesla/influence-and-legacy/scientific-and-technical-legacy/ac-grid-and-modern-power"},"next":{"title":"无线输电与未来技术的复兴","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/nikola-tesla/influence-and-legacy/scientific-and-technical-legacy/wireless-and-future-tech-revival"}}